{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "3b196dee-090a-8e2a-a43f-5dd349f343e7",
  "created_at": "2026-03-13T13:48:29-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tony Santoro",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:47:20-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:47:24-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, I'm calling about a pothole. It's at the intersection near my house, 281 Dixon Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:47:30-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 281 Dixon Street. And the pothole is at the intersection there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:47:34-04:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right. It's been patched three times now and it keeps opening back up. I talked to a guy at the corner last week and he said they filled it again in January, and I said, well, it's open again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:47:46-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three patches and it's reopened each time. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:47:49-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "And it's right in the bike lane. So somebody's going to go over their handlebars."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:47:54-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in the bike lane, okay. I'll put that in the report so the crew knows."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:47:59-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Can I get a reference number for it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:48:02-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, let me enter it. Okay, your reference number is P-W, four, four, one, seven. Let me repeat that. P-W, four, four, one, seven."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:48:10-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "P-W four four one seven. Got it. Oh, and for the location, if it helps, you can hear the school bell faintly from my yard. It's the intersection by there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:48:19-04:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That helps, thank you. I've got the school nearby noted along with 281 Dixon Street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:48:24-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Thanks, Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-13T13:48:26-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Santoro. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
